		"card_type.skill": "Skill",
		"card_type.power": "Power",
		"chapter4_intro.star.title": "Starlight Path",
		"chapter4_intro.star.body": "After the World Devourer falls, the Astral Temple does not collapse.\n\nThe shattered star map begins to rebuild itself. Silver threads of fate descend from the void, joining roads that had long been severed.\n\nYou once accepted the guidance of the stars through their quiet whisper.\n\nNow the stars answer your choice.\n\nA road into the depths of the Fate Rift appears in the light. There is no escape and no rebellion there, only final judgment and return.\n\nYou will accept fate and restore the world to the order of the stars.",
		"chapter4_intro.star.button": "Continue to the Fate Rift",
		"chapter4_intro.abyss.title": "The Abyss Answers",
		"chapter4_intro.abyss.body": "After the World Devourer falls, the Astral Temple sinks into silence.\n\nAs the last starlight begins to fade, the contract in the depths of your soul starts to burn. Black ash rises from your palm, wrapping around you like countless broken threads of fate.\n\nYou once signed the abyssal contract, seeking to seize the authority of fate.\n\nNow the abyss answers your desire.\n\nA rift that should not exist opens at the far end of the temple, and a low call echoes from within. It is not salvation, but an exchange.\n\nYou will take fate for yourself, but you must bear the price of the abyss.",
